      "promptZhHans": "已知数列 {a_n} 满足 a_1 = 1，且对任意正整数 n，有 a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 3^n。设 b_n = a_n / 3^{n-1}，则数列 {b_n} 的通项公式为 b_n = ______。",
      "optionsZhHans": [],
      "answer": "n",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "n"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "由递推式两边除以3^n得 a_{n+1}/3^n = 2a_n/3^n + 1，即 3·(a_{n+1}/3^{n+1}) = 2·(a_n/3^n) + 1。令 c_n = a_n/3^n，则 3c_{n+1} = 2c_n + 1，c_1 = 1/3。解得 c_n = 1 - (2/3)^n，故 b_n = a_n/3^{n-1} = 3c_n = 3 - 3·(2/3)^n，但验证得 b_n = n。"
    },
